SPIKE, test only (2026-11-11, CI 42876412003): NM_DIT_NO_FA=1 turns flash attention off. FLUX.1 512² 8 steps on the S25
came back as a broken frame (5.2 dB): without flash attention K^T Q is a plain fp16 matmul on HTP and FLUX.1's raw q.k
overflows it. The attention-on-CPU op filter broke the same way (that filter falls back to the same path). It is what
pointed dit/096 at attention's kv_scale. docs/IMPORTS.md, FLUX.1 stripes.

